---
title: Gingersnap Log
course: Dessert
locale: en
difficulty: Easy
---

Whip the @double cream{1%pint} and @almond essence{}, but do not make it too stiff.

Dip the @gingernut biscuits{1%packet} in the @milk, sherry or brandy{}(for dipping biscuits) and sandwich together then stand on a dish.

When all the biscuits are used cover with the rest of the cream. Then use a fork to rake the cream to look like a log.

If liked you can decorate with @crystalised ginger{}(cut into slivers).